---
source: tests/cli_git.rs
expression: help
---
Reflow broken markdown tables

Usage: mdtablefix [OPTIONS] [FILES]...

Arguments:
  [FILES]...  Markdown files to fix

Options:
      --in-place           Rewrite files in place
      --check              Report which files would be reformatted, and by how many lines
      --diff               Print a unified diff for each file that would be reformatted
      --list-files         Print the selected paths and exit, without reading or writing them
      --git                Select Markdown files tracked by Git beneath the current directory
      --include-untracked  Also select untracked files that Git does not ignore
      --md-exts <EXT>      File extensions to select under `--git` [default: md,mdc,markdown]
      --allow-conflicted   Rewrite files containing conflict markers during a merge or rebase
      --wrap               Wrap paragraphs and list items to 80 columns
      --renumber           Renumber ordered list items
      --breaks             Reformat thematic breaks as underscores
      --ellipsis           Replace "..." with the ellipsis character
      --fences             Normalize fence delimiters to three backticks
      --footnotes          Convert bare numeric references and the final numbered list to Markdown footnote links
      --code-emphasis      Fix emphasis markers adjacent to inline code
      --headings           Convert Setext-style headings to hash-prefixed headings
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
